(polyline (pts (xy 20.32 25.4) (xy 192.32 25.4)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "c7a2c4d1-eb0b-5f7f-9725-64a2c49810be"))
(text "SW2 与 C81、U102 / U103 复位监控共用 NRST；现有监控与去耦保持。\nSWD 的 NRST 仅允许外部开漏拉低。" (at 20.32 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a62ec257-48f5-5133-9b50-e0b48c1670a2"))
(text "BOOT 按钮取消；保留 10k 下拉与测试焊盘" (at 218.44 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "302917ae-0399-5cb3-bb3a-8539a6d337cd"))
(polyline (pts (xy 218.44 25.4) (xy 390.44 25.4)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "3cee527b-fac7-5977-89b9-785b942f2000"))
(text "删除 SW3 及按钮串阻 R401；沿用 R122=10k 下拉。\n日常烧录走 SWD；需要时短接 TP15(BOOT0) 与 TP16(3V3) 后复位。\n需按 pinmap 配置启动选项字节；ROM 期间 RUN_ARM 仍为低。" (at 218.44 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cf0bc1ce-0736-55a4-b582-5c0f5723d7b5"))
(text "PF0 / PF1 可选 HSE；Y1、C83、C84 默认 DNP" (at 20.32 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d3e3e371-1c3c-5b09-8406-43a8098fbf83"))
(polyline (pts (xy 20.32 139.70000000000002) (xy 398.78 139.70000000000002)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "7912d9a4-ac65-5323-bb1a-4f284759d3b3"))
(text "保持原 8 MHz / 18 pF 临时数值及 DNP，不据此宣称晶体参数已选定。\n实际 CL / ESR / 驱动等级与寄生电容待#5；C83 / C84 仅换 0603，耐压不变。\nPF0 / PF1 仅连接本地 HSE，不再引到排针。" (at 20.32 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5da91e1b-650b-5212-8be8-727476c35c57"))
